","items":[{"text":"C++/C#"},{"text":"OOP"},{"text":"DSA"},{"text":"Memory management"},{"text":"Multithreading"},{"text":"Debugging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics"},{"type":"p","text":"You may be asked about:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vectors"},{"text":"Dot product"},{"text":"Cross product"},{"text":"Matrices"},{"text":"Quaternions"},{"text":"Coordinate transformations"},{"text":"Collision mathematics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Game Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect practical questions involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Game loops"},{"text":"Physics"},{"text":"Collision detection"},{"text":"Animation"},{"text":"AI"},{"text":"Optimisation"},{"text":"Input systems"},{"text":"Scene management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Coding Challenge"},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an enemy AI that patrols between locations, detects the player, chases the player and returns to patrol when the player leaves its detection area."},{"type":"p","text":"A good solution would use:"},{"type":"flow","items":["State Machine","Navigation","Detection","Movement","Animation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"rather than hard-coded behaviour."},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Scenario"},{"type":"note","label":"Scenario","text":"Mobile Game Runs at Only 25 FPS"},{"type":"p","text":"You are asked to improve performance."},{"type":"p","text":"Do not immediately reduce graphical quality."},{"type":"p","text":"First:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Profile CPU/GPU usage."},{"text":"Identify expensive scripts."},{"text":"Check draw calls."},{"text":"Inspect texture sizes."},{"text":"Check memory usage."},{"text":"Review physics calculations."},{"text":"Check particle systems."},{"text":"Analyse garbage collection."},{"text":"Optimise asset loading."},{"text":"Test on actual target devices."},{"text":"Measure FPS and frame-time improvements."}]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates engineering thinking, not just game-engine familiarity.